148	/// Builds a fresh [_FakeAccountSettingsRepository] + [AccountSettingsCubit]
149	/// pair and pumps the real screen around it, registering both for cleanup.
150	///
151	/// Deliberately constructed *inside* each `testWidgets` body (via this
