153	/// `package:test`'s own per-test zone, a different zone than the one
154	/// `TestWidgetsFlutterBinding` establishes for the `testWidgets` callback
155	/// itself. A `StreamSubscription` (here, `AccountSettingsCubit`'s own
156	/// subscription to the repository's stream, set up in its constructor)
157	/// created in that outer zone does not reliably get its pending events
158	/// flushed by `tester.pump()`'s zone-scoped microtask draining — observed
159	/// directly: `cubit.state` updated correctly, but the `BlocBuilder`-driven
160	/// widget never rebuilt, no matter how many `pump()` calls followed.
